<section style="background:#4A0E12;color:#fff"><div class="w" style="padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:48px">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:18px;opacity:.85"><a href="index.html" style="color:#fff">Home</a> / Guided trips</nav>
<h1>Guided Theyyam trips in Kerala</h1>
<p style="font-size:18px;margin-top:20px;max-width:640px;opacity:.92">Three ways to experience Theyyam in North Malabar, each led by a local guide. Season runs late October to May. Rituals are confirmed with you closer to travel.</p>
<div class="chips"><span>Group or private</span><span>Local guide</span><span>Stay + transfers</span><span>Custom itineraries</span></div>
</div><div class="kal"></div></section>

<section class="sec"><div class="w" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px">
<article class="tr"><img src="assets/p-gold-detail.jpg" alt="Gold and red ornaments of a Theyyam costume" width="900" height="600"><div class="b"><div><span class="tag">3 nights</span><span class="tag">Base: Kannur</span><span class="tag">Beginners</span></div><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,6vw,2.6rem)">The Heritage Journey</h2><p style="margin-top:12px">Your first Theyyam, with the story behind it. Two ritual nights, one slow cultural day and a guide who translates the songs, costume and gestures.</p><ul><li>2 ritual nights with a local guide</li><li>1 day of weaving, food and coast</li><li>Boutique stay, private transfers</li></ul><div class="pr"><div><small>Price</small><div style="font-weight:800;font-size:22px">On request</div></div><a class="btn red" href="enquire.html">Enquire about this trip</a></div></div></article>

<article class="tr"><img src="assets/p-drum-crowd.jpg" alt="A Theyyam performer dancing beside a drummer" width="900" height="600"><div class="b"><div><span class="tag">5 nights</span><span class="tag">Bases: Kannur + Kanhangad</span><span class="tag">Enthusiasts</span></div><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,6vw,2.6rem)">North Malabar Deep Dive</h2><p style="margin-top:12px">Cross the district line and see how the tradition changes. More ritual nights, a visit with a Theyyam family and time to rest between late finishes.</p><ul><li>3 to 4 ritual nights, guide throughout</li><li>Time with a performing family</li><li>Two stays, all transfers</li></ul><div class="pr"><div><small>Price</small><div style="font-weight:800;font-size:22px">On request</div></div><a class="btn red" href="enquire.html">Enquire about this trip</a></div></div></article>

<article class="tr"><img src="assets/p-body-paint.jpg" alt="A performer having body paint applied before the ritual" width="900" height="720"><div class="b"><div><span class="tag">4 nights</span><span class="tag">Base: Thalassery</span><span class="tag">Craft lovers</span></div><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,6vw,2.6rem)">Craft &amp; Costume Journey</h2><p style="margin-top:12px">Meet the people behind the ritual: a costume maker, a musician, a weaver. A smaller group and a slower pace.</p><ul><li>Group of up to 5</li><li>Pre-trip briefing on ritual etiquette</li><li>Flexible rest days</li></ul><div class="pr"><div><small>Price</small><div style="font-weight:800;font-size:22px">On request</div></div><a class="btn red" href="enquire.html">Enquire about this trip</a></div></div></article>
</div></section>

<section aria-label="Why travellers trust us" style="padding:32px 0 8px"><div class="w"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px"><div style="flex:1 1 220px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:20px;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff"><b style="font-size:40px;font-weight:800;color:#D7261E;line-height:1">8+</b><span style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.35">years organising Theyyam tours</span></div><div style="flex:1 1 220px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:20px;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff"><b style="font-size:40px;font-weight:800;color:#D7261E;line-height:1">500+</b><span style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.35">explorers hosted on Theyyam trips</span></div><div style="flex:1 1 220px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:20px;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff"><b style="font-size:40px;font-weight:800;color:#D7261E;line-height:1">24x7</b><span style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.35">support for booked trips</span></div></div><p style="font-size:13px;margin:14px 0 0;opacity:.75">Powered by letsgoforacamp</p></div></section><section style="padding:8px 0 56px"><div class="w"><p class="eyebrow" style="color:#D7261E;margin:0 0 12px">Two ways to travel</p><h2 style="margin-bottom:24px;max-width:720px">Join a group or make it yours</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px"><div style="flex:1 1 280px;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;background:#fff"><h3>Small group departures</h3><p style="margin:10px 0 20px">Share the journey with up to 8 like-minded travellers. Departure windows are shared when you enquire.</p><a class="btn" href="enquire.html">Enquire about a group trip</a></div><div style="flex:1 1 280px;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;background:#fff"><h3>Private and customised</h3><p style="margin:10px 0 20px">Your own dates, pace and interests, for family, friends, a special-interest group or a solo explorer. We design it with you.</p><a class="btn" href="enquire.html">Enquire about a custom trip</a></div></div></div></section><section class="sec" style="background:#FFB400"><div class="w">
<h2 style="margin-bottom:28px">What every trip includes</h2>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px">
<div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:24px;padding:26px"><h3>Included</h3><ul style="margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:20px"><li>Local Theyyam guide</li><li>Stays and breakfast</li><li>Private road transfers</li><li>Ritual access, arranged by us</li></ul></div>
<div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:24px;padding:26px"><h3>Not included</h3><ul style="margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:20px"><li>Flights to Kannur or Mangaluru</li><li>Travel insurance</li><li>Personal spending</li></ul></div>
<div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #1a0a08;border-radius:24px;padding:26px"><h3>Good to know</h3><ul style="margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:20px"><li>Rituals run late into the night</li><li>Modest dress is expected</li><li>Rituals confirmed before you pay in full</li></ul></div>
</div></div></section>

<section style="background:#D7261E;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:72px 0 0"><div class="w"><h2>Not sure which trip fits?</h2><p style="font-size:18px;margin:16px auto 28px;max-width:520px">Tell us your month and group. We will suggest the right one.</p><a class="btn" href="enquire.html">Enquire about a trip</a></div><img src="assets/palms-maroon.svg" alt="" width="1440" height="220" style="width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:40px"></section>
</main>

